%% Gate token + scan session + check-in (SDD §9.1-§9.3; gate/token.ts, scanSessions.ts, gate/routes.ts)
%% Step numbers are part of the labels (no autonumber markers over the text).
sequenceDiagram
  participant D as Gate display
  participant P as Guest phone
  participant A as API
  participant DB as Database
  Note over D: code = gate + time step + 80-bit signature
  Note over D: 1. new QR every 10 s (works offline)
  Note over P: 2. scan QR, GPS fix
  P->>A: 3. send code, one-time number, GPS
  Note over A: 4. code ≤ 30 s old, signature valid
  Note over A: 5. within the gate circle? GPS ≤ 60 s old?
  A->>DB: 6. save scan session (10 min)
  A-->>P: 7. session id, GPS ok?
  P->>A: 8. ask what is allowed (one-time number)
  A-->>P: 9. allowed actions + host's name
  P->>A: 10. live photo (≤ 3 MB, details removed)
  P->>A: 11. check in (safe to resend)
  A->>DB: 12. one transaction: rules, visit → inside,<br/>gate event, audit record, notification
  A-->>P: 13. "You're checked in"
